(c) prescribing the content and form of a notice to be given under sub-section 78b (1) and specifying the documents (if any) that are to accompany such a notice;
(d) prescribing the practice and procedure for the filing and giving of such a notice, including the manner in which, the time within which, the persons to whom, and the persons by whom, such a notice is to be given; and
(e) specifying any affidavits to be filed following the giving of a notice under sub-section 78b (1) and prescribing the persons by whom and times within which the affidavits are to be filed.”.
